      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- =======================================================
     ABOUT
     ======================================================= -->

<section
  id="about"
  class="section about-section"
>

  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="about-grid">


      <article class="about-card reveal">

        <div class="section-kicker">
          About KAIVYRA
        </div>


        <h2>

          Curious about difficult problems.
          Serious about useful solutions.

        </h2>


        <p>

          KAIVYRA is an emerging technology venture exploring
          problems across healthcare, education, artificial
          intelligence and digital systems.

        </p>


        <p>

          The approach is deliberately simple: understand the
          problem first, investigate what matters, build carefully,
          and improve through real-world learning.

        </p>


        <a
          href="#approach"
          class="text-link"
        >

          See how we approach problems

          <span>→</span>

        </a>

